        "1.00": "Strong, explicit mannish or menswear-inspired construction."
      },
      "neutral_hint": "For skirts and dresses, start from 0.50 (neutral). Do not score an item as feminine, soft-romantic or mannish merely because it is a skirt or dress. Absence of mannish cues is not evidence of strong femininity. Move away from 0.50 only when explicit garment-level construction, draping, ornament or menswear-inspired tailoring clearly supports the direction. If both directions remain plausible, or evidence is weak, score 0.50. Ignore the wearer's gender, body and pose.",
